<div class="container">

<!-- HEADER -->
<div class="header">
<h1>Amazon Product Catalog Performance & Customer Sentiment Analysis</h1>
<p>Comprehensive analysis of {len(valid):,} Amazon India products across pricing strategies, discount effectiveness, customer ratings, and category-level performance. Data-driven insights to guide assortment curation, pricing adjustments, and promotional planning.</p>
